WEBVTT

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.150
Would you try to understand your place?

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.650
What's going on? What's that?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.480
Selena...

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.840
Hey, what's going on here?

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.740
He asked Selena-san to be his girlfriend.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.370
And gave her a ring instead of a song.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.290
What? Not even a little tune of love?

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.500
How could he think that 
would work on a Diva?

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.570
Yeah.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:38.620
Selena-sama is the pride of the Bird People.
She has beauty and a beautiful voice.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:42.150
I hate to say it,
but he's not worthy of her.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:48.810
There's no way I would take the 
hand of a man dressed like that,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.110
who can't even sing.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.610
Have a pleasant day.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.310
Selena...

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.360
Selena!

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.260
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.340
<b>The King of the Song Altar and the Diva in a Cage (Part 1)</b>

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.130
So this is Particio!

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:41.870
It's even more beautiful than I imagined!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.470
It does feel like a place you'd like, Merc.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.050
Yes!

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.730
Jamo-san said we'd be 
here longer than usual.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.330
Let's take our time looking around.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.340
What's wrong?

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.980
You're actually excited about the journey.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.060
I wonder if that means it's going to rain!

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.990
It does not.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.320
Tickets for the new Diva's 
first concert are on sale now!

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:13.070
We haven't been able to hear a Diva's 
voice since Selena-sama's last concert!

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:16.930
And she hasn't done one for a long while!

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:22.560
I heard that Diva Antel isn't just a 
great singer. He's beautiful, too!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:26.850
They're really excited.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.010
Yeah.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.760
I can't get out!

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:35.660
Yuu-san, somebody's drowning in there!

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.230
Watch out!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.400
Are you okay?

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:50.760
Thank y'all for helpin' me.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.860
I'm Forna.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:56.130
I just came in from out in th' country.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.200
D-Dang, my accent probably 
sounds disgraceful, don't it?

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.470
N-No, it's just... your voice...

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:06.140
It's really beautiful!

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.060
My voice is...

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.510
My voice is the only thing my 
kinfolk ever liked about me.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:21.900
Oh, it's like a dream...

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:30.280
I've come to Particio,
the place I longed to be!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:34.830
My voice is the one thing 
people compliment me for,

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.970
but I can also sing and dance okay.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:42.250
I may have these freckles,

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.650
and these clothes may be old,

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:54.030
but maybe I can be somebody special, too!

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.360
Huh?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.850
What's wrong?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:02.310
Sorry! That song was 
downright awful, wasn't it?

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.400
N-No... That's not it.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:09.240
We're surprised that you suddenly 
started singing and dancing.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.260
Really?

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:13.340
But singin' is what somebody 
does when they're happy, ain't it?

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.880
So y'all don't even sing "The Tune of Love"?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:19.950
The Tune...

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:20.910
...of Love?

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:24.750
If you did that in the kingdom, 
you'd freak people out.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.000
Yeah.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.310
You don't ask people out with songs.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.080
Really?

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.020
Takes all kinds to make a world, huh?

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.320
Yeah...

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.920
Sure does.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.970
Okay, Forna-san! See you around!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.270
I hope you get your tickets next time.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:46.480
Thank y'all! I'll do my best!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:52.980
They ain't from Particio, 
but I'm still glad I made some friends!

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.960
You're...

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.340
Diva Selena?!

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.500
Be quiet.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:08.120
She's a cute, retro-style girl!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:11.150
I think we could make those freckles work!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.720
I want your help with something.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.390
M-My help?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.280
That's right.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.930
The Diva herself needs you.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.010
Um...

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.980
First, calm down with 
some tea and a muffin.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:29.280
Okay?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.710
Next, let's go to that art museum!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:36.570
Okay.

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:39.550
But this museum looks good, too.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:43.980
The concert programs are on sale early?

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.320
Those guys again!

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.240
With limited edition merchandise!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.090
It's a must-buy, then!

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.550
Dodge!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.570
There's no time!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.040
Secret Technique: Close My Own Lid!

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:05.890
Ow...

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.960
Are you okay?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.240
Yeah, you okay? And... um, sorry, Toto.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.610
I'm fine.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:21.060
Help me!

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:31.590
I-I'm in... Diva Selena's... mansion!

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.080
Here.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:36.030
First, drink up so your throat isn't so dry.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:38.990
Th-Thank y-y'all...

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.850
I don't like small talk,

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.140
so I'll get right to the point.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.440
R-Right...

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:50.060
I want you to take my place.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.130
Take... your place?

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.970
Yes. Take my place.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.620
You may not have noticed,
but your voice is similar to Selena's.

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:08.620
All we need from you is your voice.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.890
You were singing at the plaza, right?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.250
When I heard you, I realized 
you were something special!

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:20.510
Of course, I mean as a stand-in.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.860
Selena will stand on the stage.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.490
And you'll...

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:28.750
...stand next to her and sing?

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.350
Bravo! That's right!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:37.620
B-B-But your voice was right
 purty at the last concert!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:38.410
Why—

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:43.070
That's not something you need 
to know right now, is it?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.840
I want an answer.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.650
Yes or no.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.080
Um...

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.850
Yes? Or no?

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.570
Um...

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.050
Yes, I s'pose.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.800
I'm glad. Thank you.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.600
All right, Lupie.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.750
You take care of the rest.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:16.580
So, um... what do I...

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.830
Miss Forna, allow me to introduce myself.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.700
I'm Lupie.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:26.720
A producer, a master of tap dance 
and composing, and an entertainer.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:31.010
And from now on, I'm your coach.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:35.630
My job is to change mud into pure water.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.430
You're no exception!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.500
Don't worry.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:45.850
Leave it all to me, and you'll be a 
singer that all of Particio envies!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.680
All of P-Particio?

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:49.820
Yup!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.680
Sheesh...

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.860
That sucked.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.410
Yup.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.540
It's too dark to see,

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.890
but this looks like a big sewer.

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.810
How do we get back up?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:11.190
We'll have to look for some stairs.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:15.210
Um...

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.510
Wh-Who are you?

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.500
Um... well...

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:25.140
We ran into some customers 
and fell down here.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:27.570
I'm sorry about that.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:31.380
There's no reason for you to apologize.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:35.090
Maybe... but I want to.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.720
Do you know the layout of these sewers?

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.280
Yeah.

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:48.120
I once came down here to catch bugs.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:48.970
Bugs?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.130
Sometimes fireflies come down here.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.540
That's a monster!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.250
Yeah.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.090
No! I need to stop her!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.020
U-Um...

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.520
You...

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:24.370
A talking monster!

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:27.240
Voicia...

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:33.790
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.160
Is that a monster?

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:44.190
It looks like a big jewel, too.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.610
You're that reckless young bird from before?

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.300
Yes.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.180
I've been waiting for you.

00:11:55.180 --> 00:12:00.200
It took time to get you what you wanted.

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:04.730
You'll be free soon.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:09.350
But when you are, keep your promise with me.

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.340
Give her that voice.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:18.010
Young bird, obsessed with love...

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:24.710
I don't care about that 
arrogant girl, but...

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:32.210
Since you were kind enough to come 
see me before the day of our promise,

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:35.220
for now, I will nod.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:39.120
But I cannot wait longer.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:43.820
I have started to fade.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:46.450
Yes...

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.470
S-Sorry.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.640
I know this is kind of weird.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:53.670
It's okay, but...

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:57.340
Um, what's that monster?

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:02.110
Oh, I made a certain promise 
with Voicia here before.

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.760
Oh, no!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.040
It's way past rehearsal time.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.040
Rehearsal?

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:09.360
Rehearsal?

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:11.410
Antel, wait!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:15.980
Sorry, I'll show you the way out. Follow me.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.120
Okay!

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:37.130
Okay, that's all for today.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:42.720
To be honest, there are some 
parts that need work.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:47.230
But the way you've grown over the past 
few days is more than I imagined, Forna.

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:48.600
R-Really?

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:53.100
It's just 'cause you're a good teacher.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:58.020
True! No other bird person 
can teach like me.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:00.840
Okay, let's head out.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.980
Wh-Where to?

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.250
The stage next door.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:09.480
Let's go hear the best voice in the world.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.000
The new Diva's concert?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.710
But ain't it sold out?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.140
Who do you think I am?

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:29.090
Programs! Get your programs here!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.610
Looks like this is the place.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:40.300
Wow, VIP seats!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.730
Is this really okay?

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:46.800
The guy we met in the sewer 
gave Toto and me our own seats!

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:50.320
He's so generous!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.130
Yuu! Merc!

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:55.690
Huh?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.180
Forna-san!

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.700
It's been a while, except it hasn't!

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:02.270
I'm happy to see y'all again!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.280
Friends of yours?

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:06.350
They're the first friends I made 
after I came to Particio!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.920
I see.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:12.360
I'm Lupie, the hot producer.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:13.260
Nice to meet you.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.220
H-Hi...

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.580
Yuu-san, it's about to start.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:19.730
Right, right.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:26.230
<i>I'd know that suspicious-lookin'
 outfit anywhere.</i>

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.730
<i>Selena-san?</i>

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:30.680
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:34.020
<i>She seems upset.</i>

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:35.740
It's starting.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.190
R-Right!

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.410
It's finally time!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.860
So beautiful...

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:06.190
The monsters are helping make the stage.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.230
Lupie-san, is this part of the act?

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:19.200
No, this voice...

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:22.200
Why is my voice...?

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.000
The monsters are out of control!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.750
Why are the monsters attacking us?

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.080
Yuu-san!

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:07.900
Believing you'd return it,

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:16.520
I sought love...

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:31.600
Those days when we were born together,
 grew up together...

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:40.070
But there was nothing there.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:50.700
Just cold gazes staring from a distance.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:58.210
Beauty, beauty...

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:06.350
Beauty! Am I unloved

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:14.200
as punishment for my ugliness?

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:22.230
I hate it! I hate it so much!

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:29.010
Antel...

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.370
That's...

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:35.140
That's the man we met in the 
sewer who gave us the tickets!

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:47.390
I believed you would answer me

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:53.080
and sought love.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:19:07.340
Those days when together we laughed...

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:16.890
But were those just an illusion?

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:27.310
A fool who only looked at dreams...

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:35.320
Beauty, beauty...

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:43.080
Love unrequited...

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:51.260
Is it a punishment for my ignorance?

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:58.470
Even if it's sad, I want to know.

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:06.470
But my loneliness is over.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:14.180
Now as I stand on this stage, I swear,

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:23.020
I shall sing as my vow leads me.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.380
Selena...

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:43.210
Bravo! Bravo!

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:56.700
Maybe that was a little too much for her.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.020
I...

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.320
Too much beauty...

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.780
It's almost like violence.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:08.300
Now he has become a true Diva.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.550
Antel...

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:29.770
Why?

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:26.810
It's me, Titi!

00:23:26.810 --> 00:23:27.720
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:31.000
<i>Merc StoriA: the Musical</i> has begun!

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:33.340
Is it time for me to be a Diva, too?

00:23:33.840 --> 00:23:34.700
Huh?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.330
Next time, "The King of the Song Altar 
and the Diva in a Cage." Part 2!

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>The King of the Song Altar and the Diva in a Cage (Part 2)</b>
